The files in this directory are the HAETAE 1.2.0 reference implementation
(Team HAETAE, MIT License, below) with modifications for the Cortex-M4 by
YoungBeom Kim (MIT License, below); the file headers say which files are
modified.  fft.S and sample_gauss83.S are new (YoungBeom Kim, MIT License,
below); their tables are generated from the reference fft.c and sampler.c.
Exceptions:

- ntt332.S and ntt332_macros.i: the NTT and inverse NTT in assembly from the
  Dilithium implementation of pqm4, based on code by Markus Krausz, licensed
  under CC0 with permission of the authors (see the file headers); adapted to
  the HAETAE prime in the earlier pqm4 HAETAE m4f implementation and modified
  for HAETAE 1.2.0 by YoungBeom Kim (also under CC0).
- rans_byte.h: the rANS coder of the reference implementation, by Fabian
  Giesen, public domain (see the file header); modified by YoungBeom Kim
  (also in the public domain).

